      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-11-03T00:09:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I mean to clarify that \"the value of depfile-out could have just as easily been implemented as an implicit output, although before any future maintainers consider changing the command-line usage to just make it into an implicit out, they may wish to reconsider whether there will ever be an advantage from knowing that it\u0027s specifically an output depfile\"\n\nI\u0027ll just remove it if you don\u0027t like it",
      "parentUuid": "05709f1f_2541ec27",
      "revId": "d838af50f264ac46e724e142298d2bf13ccacdc7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
